    <string name="exercise_name_malyshev_circle_tracking">Circular Tracking</string>
    <string name="exercise_instruction_square">Trace the outline of an imaginary square with your eyes. Four points of fixation.</string>
    <string name="exercise_instruction_snake">Move your eyes along a horizontal wavy path, then back.</string>
    <string name="exercise_instruction_palming">Rub your palms together until warm, then place them over your closed eyes. Deep relaxation.</string>
    <string name="exercise_instruction_focus_approach">Extend your finger, then slowly bring it closer to your nose, maintaining focus.</string>
    <string name="exercise_instruction_butterfly">Blink lightly and very quickly, like a butterfly flapping its wings.</string>
    <string name="exercise_instruction_infinity">Smoothly trace the infinity symbol with your eyes. First one way, then the other.</string>
    <string name="exercise_instruction_nose_writing">Close your eyes. Imagine your nose is a pencil and write the alphabet in the air.</string>
    <string name="exercise_instruction_malyshev_switches">Raise both thumbs at shoulder width. Move your gaze clearly from right thumb to left and back 30 times, then place one thumb above the other and switch your gaze up and down 30 times.</string>
    <string name="exercise_instruction_malyshev_convergence">Cover one open eye with your palm. Focus on the opposite thumb or pencil and slowly bring it toward the bridge of your nose 10 times. Switch sides and repeat.</string>
    <string name="exercise_instruction_malyshev_circle_tracking">Stretch one arm forward and focus on your thumb. Draw a small circle in the air and follow it without turning your head: 10 circles clockwise and 10 counterclockwise, then switch hands.</string>
